    - target: {fileID: 6380436179282662226, guid: 76354cb641cf5aa46ba4902d9b7024f7, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: '<font="bold">Lelystad Centrum </font>is a railway station in the town
        of <font="bold">Lelystad, Netherlands</font>. The station is on the Flevolijn
        and Hanzelijn and the train services are operated by Nederlandse Spoorwegen.
        The station was opened on 28 May 1988 after the extension from Almere Buiten
        was completed. The station was doubled in size to 4 platforms to accommodate
        the increase in trains following the opening of the Hanzelijn on 9 December
        2012. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
